  | symbol memcpy in memcpy.o
  | symbol strlen in strlen.o
  | Error EO0001: 'not elf' is damaged: it is not an ELF64 little-endian object
  | Error EO0001: 'cut header' is damaged: its ELF header runs past its end
  | Error EO0001: 'class 32' is damaged: it is not an ELF64 little-endian object
  | Error EO0001: 'entry size' is damaged: its section headers are not 64 bytes each
  | Error EO0001: 'cut table' is damaged: its section header table runs past its end
  | Error EO0001: 'section name' is damaged: section 2 names a place its section name table does not hold
  | Error EO0001: 'section data' is damaged: section 2 says its data runs past its end
  | Error EO0001: 'name table' is damaged: its section name table, section 2, is no string table it holds
